": \"Stream name is one of the mandatry field for every Nimbrel Probe agent\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The stream name cant contain arbitrary symbols as documented in the linked page.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"The stream name cant contain arbitrary symbols as documented\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names may only contain letters, digits, spaces and hyphens, and nothing else, or the agent refuses to start.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"Put plainly: letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else, or the agent refuses to start.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"One customer wanted the stream name left exactly as it stood because that string was the product name in use everywhere in the org.\",\n      \"line\": 15,\n      \"span\": \"one customer wanted the stream name left exactly as it stood because that string was the product name in use everywhere in the org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The customer's reporting keyed off the stream name string.\",\n      \"line\": 15,\n      \"span\": \"their reporting keyed of it when\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The workaround applies to all Nimbrel Probe agents.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"All Nimbrel Probe agents\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The first step of the workaround is to rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"Rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The second step of the workaround is to carry the original name along as a global tag, so each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"Then carry the orignal name along as a global tag, so at least each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":6410,"type":"result","duration_ms":6525,"uuid":"70fc6c9c-13f2-4049-b44c-c87c958a15ae","ttft_stream_ms":994,"time_to_request_ms":102,"first_content_frame_ms":995,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
